(text "INTEGRATION\nImport this sheet and its two children; wire all 10 border pins in the parent.\nMaster owns chip, main supply entry/current break, scan header and ground tie.\nJ_AUX supplies AUX_5V; connect its source return to board AGND.\nOPA333 SOIC-8: +IN 3, -IN 2, V+ 7, V- 4, OUT 6; pads 1/5/8 unused.\nREF feedback is sensed after R_REFISO; C_REF2A and C_REF2B are populated." (at 15.24 345 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fa1e4250-79e3-40e2-a078-e3db098c4daf"))
